"տվյալների աղբյուր:</ahelp>"

#: 12090100.xhp#par_id3150011.13.help.text
#: 12090100.xhp%23par_id3150011.13.help.text
msgid ""
"The data columns in the pivot table use the same number format as the first "
"data row in the current selection."
msgstr ""
