#: 05100000.xhp%23par_id3155531.12.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\"HID_TEMPLDLG_WATERCAN\">Turns the Fill Format mode on and off. "
"Use the paint can to assign the Style selected in the Styles and Formatting "
