#: 12040201.xhp#par_id3147228.6.help.text
#: 12040201.xhp%23par_id3147228.6.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_SPEC_FILTER:BTN_CASE\">Distinguishes "
