msgstr "<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090300.xhp\" name=\"Ջնջել\">Ջնջել</link>"

#: 12090300.xhp#par_id3159400.2.help.text
#: 12090300.xhp%23par_id3159400.2.help.text
