"<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NAMES:BTN_ROWHEADER\">Defines the area as "
"a repeating row.</ahelp>"
msgstr ""
"<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_NAMES:BTN_ROWHEADER\">Սահմանում է "
"տիրույթը որպես կրկնվող տող։</ahelp>"

#: 04070100.xhp#hd_id3155112.27.help.text
#: 04070100.xhp%23hd_id3155112.27.help.text
